"id": "service-quote",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section service-quote\" id=\"service-quote\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Toilet repair and replacement costs in Perth</h2><div class=\"price-guide\" aria-labelledby=\"ellis-price-guide\">\n            <div class=\"shell\">\n              <div class=\"price-guide__intro\">\n                <p class=\"price-guide__kicker\">Ellis Price Guide</p>\n                <h2 id=\"ellis-price-guide\">Toilet repairs price guide</h2>\n                <p>\n                  A practical guide for a standard toilet repair at a Perth\n                  property.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"price-guide__grid\">\n                <article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n                  <h3>Toilet repairs</h3>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $165–$330</p>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per repair · incl. GST</p>\n                </article>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"price-guide__notice\">\n                <strong>Guide conditions:</strong> These AUD ranges are for\n                standard-hours, standard-scope work and are incl. GST. Access,\n                materials, extra pipe, cable or circuit work, compliance work,\n                emergency or after-hours work and unforeseen repairs are\n                confirmed in a written quote before work proceeds.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div><h3>What your written quote covers</h3><p>A running cistern, poor flush, leaking connection and drainage blockage are different repair requests. The affected component, toilet type, condition and access determine the repair scope. We explain whether the work is at the fixture or relates to the drainage, and confirm parts and any additional work in writing.</p><p>The final written quote sets out the work included, materials and any agreed additional tasks. We explain changes to the scope before extra work proceeds. <a href=\"contact.html?service=toilet-repairs-perth.html\">Request a toilet repair quote</a>.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq service-editorial-faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Toilet Repairs Perth — Cistern &amp; Flush Repairs FAQs</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Separate a cistern fault from blocked drainage</h3><p>Water running into the bowl, slow filling or an ineffective flush can involve the fixture. Water rising or backing up may involve drainage. Describe both if they occur together. A blocked bowl does not establish that the entire toilet needs replacement.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">Blocked toilet and drainage assessment</a></li><li><a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Toilet replacement and connection scope</a></li><li><a href=\"toilet-installation-perth.html\">Toilet Installation &amp; Replacement Perth</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:4:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:4:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:5:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:5:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:6:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:6:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:7:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:7:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:8:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:8:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:9:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:9:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:10:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:10:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"items": [
{
"question": "Should I book toilet repairs or drain clearing for a backed-up bowl?",
"answer": "<p>Explain whether the water rises when flushed and whether other outlets are affected. The drainage page is the starting point for backups; the toilet repair page covers cistern, fill, flush and fitting faults. The assessment confirms the actual work.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Is a complete new toilet needed when the cistern keeps running?",
"answer": "<p>Not necessarily. The fixture condition and repair parts need assessment first. If replacement is proposed, confirm the product, connections and any additional work in the written scope.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What is the difference between a running toilet and a leaking toilet base?",
"answer": "<p>A running cistern passes or replenishes water internally; a base leak is external water with a source that needs checking. <a href=\"#learn-about-toilet-repairs-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Why does my toilet keep refilling on its own?",
"answer": "<p>Unwanted water loss from the cistern can trigger refilling. Inspection determines which component, if any, needs repair. <a href=\"#learn-about-toilet-repairs-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Do I need to diagnose the problem first?",
"answer": "<p>No. Describe the observable change and property context. We inspect the affected area on site to establish the cause and confirm the repair scope. If more access is needed, we agree it with you first.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can I send photos?",
"answer": "<p>Photos are optional: email safely taken photos to maxinemaintenance.au@outlook.com. You can contact us without photos. Do not approach a hazard, remove covers or dismantle equipment to take a photo.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What if the toilet is running constantly?",
"answer": "<p>Tell us whether it is continuously running, whether there is water on the floor and whether the fixture can still be used.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What should I do if it is overflowing?",
"answer": "<p>Avoid further use and keep people away from contaminated water. Contact us with the property details and the situation.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Could a blocked toilet involve other drains?",
"answer": "<p>Tell us if another fixture is also slow, gurgling or backing up. That context helps distinguish a toilet-specific concern from a broader drainage issue.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can you help with multiple toilets at one property?",
"answer": "<p>Yes. Identify each affected fixture and its symptoms in the enquiry.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Does every running toilet need to be replaced?",
"answer": "<p>No. We assess the component fault, condition and availability of compatible parts. A complete replacement is a separate option with its own installation requirements and written scope.</p>" as TrustedHtml
}
]
},
{
"id": "service-booking",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section contact-band service-booking\" id=\"service-booking\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Book toilet repair in Perth</h2><p>Send the suburb, whether the issue is filling, flushing, leaking or drainage, and whether other fixtures are affected. Let us know if the cistern is concealed and provide the work-order reference for a managed property. Our local team covers <a href=\"service-areas.html\">all six Perth service regions</a> from our office at 140 St Georges Terrace, Perth WA 6000.</p><p>Call to discuss the work or send the property details through our enquiry form. You do not need to diagnose the fault or complete a technical inspection before contacting us.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=toilet-repairs-perth.html\">Request a visit &amp; written quote</a></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
